he Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nI have had acrophobia since I was a young child. Today, at work, the elevator was out of order, and I had to take the stairs to reach my office. I considered it a small exercise since I haven't had much time to work out recently. My office is on the last floor of this tall building.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would I ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Excitement\nB) Fear\nC) Disapproval\nD) Nervousness\nE) Hopeless\nF) Pride\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would I feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) I was afraid of taking the stairs due to my acrophobia\nB) I was about to meet an important client at my office\nC) I found it nice to have a chance to exercise\nD) I was worried about not showing up to work because of the elevator being out of order","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575014847700355,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e897d6006945d2809bd5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369687528,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:27","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7161560cf3174580bbe7c06510dbe780"}